  "content": "These\nwords he speaks are\ntrue We're all\nhumanary stew\nWe don't pledge allegiance to\nThe Black Widow\n\n[Intro]\n[E5]  [G5]  [D5]\n[E5]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\nThe\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Em]horror that he brings\n[G]The\n[Em]horror of his sting\n[A5]The un-\n[Em]holiest of kings\n[Bb5]The Black\n[Em]Widow\nOur\n[Em]minds will be his toy\n[G]And\n[Em]every girl and\nboy [A5]will\n[Em]learn to be employed\n[Bb5]The Black\n[Em]Widow\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Love me\nYes we\nlove me\n[Emadd9]Love him\nYes we\nlove him\n[Am6]Love me\nYes we\n[F#7/A#]love him\n[B]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[E5]  [G5]  [D5]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\nHe\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Em]sits upon his throne\n[G]and\n[Em]picks at all the bones\n[A5]of his\n[Em]Husbands and his Wives\n[Bb5]he's de-\n[Em]voured\nHe\n[Em]stares with a gleam\n[G]With a\n[Em]laugh so obscene\n[A5]at the\n[Em]virgins and the child-\n[Bb5]ren He's de-\n[Em]flowered\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Love me\nYes we\nlove me\n[Emadd9]Love him\nYes we\nlove him\n[Am6]Love me\nYes we\n[F#7/A#]love him\n[B]\n[E5]  [G5]  [D5]\n\n[Solo]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\n[Em]\n[F]\n[Em]\nOur\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Em]thoughts are hot and crazed\n[G]Our\n[Em]brains are webbed in haze\n[A5]Of\n[Em]mindless senseless daze\n[Bb5]The Black\n[Em]Widow\nThese\n[Em]words he speaks are true\n[G]We're all\n[Em]humanary stew\n[A5]If we don't\n[Em]pledge allegiance to\n[Bb5]\n[Em]The Black\n\n[Outro 1]\nWidow\n[D]\n[D/C]\n[G]\n[D]\n[D/C]\n[G]\n[D]\n\n[Outro 2]\n[D/C]\n[F#dim7]\n[F#7]\n[B]\nThe Black\nWidow\n\n[Outro 3]\n[E5]  [B5]\n[C5]\n[Asus2]",
